# Geometry cross-check fixtures: 1.2 MB of real ORS route geometry, regenerated
# on demand by tools/measure-geometry.py against the box. Kept out of git on
# purpose — ORS results are licensed CC-BY-SA 4.0, and committing route data to
# a public repo is redistributing it as a dataset, which is the one case SPEC.md
# flags the share-alike clause as biting. Displaying routes in the app is fine;
# shipping them as a file is a different thing.
tools/geometry-check/fixtures.json

# Stray root wrangler config. wrangler creates one here if `deploy` is run from
# the repo root instead of worker/, and then deploys the wrong thing — it did on
# 2026-09-03, publishing docs/ as a Worker named "imless". worker/wrangler.toml
# is the only config this project has.
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.jsonc.stray-*
